      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://cityofedinburgh.com/about/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The city hosts the world’s largest arts festival, the Edinburgh Festival Fringe, showcasing diverse performances each summer.",
